<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria Sept producer prices up 13.2 pct mth/mth.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria Sept producer prices up 13.2 pct mth/mth.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's monthly producer price inflation was 13.2 percent in September, National Statistics Institute (NSI) figures showed.</p>
<p> BULGARIAN PRODUCER PRICES   SEPT	 AUG	  SEPT'95</p>
<p> monthly pct change	   +13.2	+17.6	  +5.2</p>
<p> yr/yr pct change	    +183.7     +159.6	   N.A.</p>
<p>No further details were immediately available. -- Sofia Newsroom, 359-2-84561</p>
</text>
